From 7412f5c562010c8a3cead2d085715f792e1500e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yangmin Li <yangminl@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:29:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] [Perf] [NVIDIA] DSpark: Enable the simulated-acceptance
 fast paths on CUDA

Under SGLANG_SIMULATE_ACC_LEN the verify skips the accept sampling whose
result is overwritten, folds the accept and the sampled bonus into the
verify graph, and treats temperature-only rows as greedy. These were
gated to HIP; drop the gate so CUDA takes the same paths. No effect when
SGLANG_SIMULATE_ACC_LEN is unset.
---
 .../srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_verify.py    | 5 ++---
 .../srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_worker_v2.py | 8 ++------
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

